# Site settings passed into the core container (copy to core.env). Anything the
# systemd install keeps in /etc/moreopenrepeater/env goes here, for example:
# MOREOPENREPEATER_USRP_ADDRESS=127.0.0.1

# How many seconds the controller or the audio engine may go without progress before the core counts it as
# stalled (default 10, from 2 to 300). The container's health check and the watchdog that restarts the core
# (MOREOPENREPEATER_EXIT_ON_STALL, set in compose.yaml) both use it. It is also how long the transmitter can
# stay keyed if the sound card vanishes mid-transmission. See "Health and restarts" in docs/docker.md.
# MOREOPENREPEATER_STALL_SECONDS=10
